The transparency helper (mglass/) is Phemio's own Rust code. The way it
reaches the XAML of the taskbar and File Explorer follows the approach
described by TranslucentTB (https://github.com/TranslucentTB/TranslucentTB)
and the Windhawk "Windows 11 File Explorer Styler" mod; neither project's
source code is included here.

Third-party Rust crates used by Phemio are listed in Cargo.lock and
mglass/Cargo.lock, each under its own license.
